👉 Difference:

DeiT = ViT + Distillation Token + Pretraining strategy.

In practice, in Keras/TF we don’t reimplement everything from scratch — instead, we can use HuggingFace Transformers (they already have DeiT implemented).

---------------------------
Instead of manual ViT building, we directly used HuggingFace’s DeiT (facebook/deit-base-distilled-patch16-224).

Handles distillation internally.

You can fine-tune on your Cat vs Dog dataset with very little data.

